# Release Readiness

For medium/high-risk changes:

- Declare risk level (low/medium/high).
- Define rollback plan before completion.
- Define abort criteria (when to stop rollout/revert).
- Identify external dependencies (APIs, config, credentials).
- Note whether change is production-ready or environment-blocked.
